;
SHEET
DETERMINATION METHOD: DSSP
THE SHEETS PRESENTED AS "AA" IN EACH CHAIN ON SHEET RECORDS
BELOW IS ACTUALLY AN  7-STRANDED BARREL THIS IS REPRESENTED BY
A  8-STRANDED SHEET IN WHICH THE FIRST AND LAST STRANDS
ARE IDENTICAL.
